  "description": "Introduce portable graph-path helpers (resolveGraphPath, UNC/drive absolute detection) so Windows FS resolves match forward-slash graph keys. Adopts them in PHP require/include and explain drive-letter outsides, hardens TS/Python relative imports, and unblocks Windows CI path-identity failures without test-only skips for separators.",
